"\n"
"    Returns the file directly with appropriate Content-Type and\n"
"    Content-Disposition headers (not wrapped in JSON envelope).\n"
"\n"
"    **Report types:** products, customers, categories, brands, orders, summary\n"
"    **Formats:** csv, pdf\n"
